  "title": "US President Trump Implements Media Bans on CNN, MS NOW, and Politico Amid Tensions",
  "summary": "The US President has imposed bans on major news outlets like CNN, MS NOW, and Politico, citing concerns about their role in spreading fake news, while maintaining a tense relationship with media during his political career. A federal appeals court has ordered the halt of a White House ballroom construction project, with the White House press dinner rescheduled amid a shooting in April.",
